{"version":1,"key":"card:763","content":{"id":763,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"921dc0f3-a438-411d-897f-444c0ceff3da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"「我不杀伯仁，伯仁却因我而死」这句话常用来表示，一件事虽然不是自己直接造成的，但自己却负有不可推卸的间接责任。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"595a1a34-83d8-4662-bd19-966edae7de3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背后的故事读来让人唏嘘。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"950be328-8564-44c7-9454-4ba2ae5c2a08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"西晋灭亡后，琅邪王司马睿（晋元帝）建立东晋，王导是核心辅臣，他的堂兄王敦是大将，功高盖主，发动叛乱，攻入建康（现南京）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3564e224-8198-421e-8a38-62c574966419","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"王导的处境就很微妙，因为他是王敦的堂弟，大家对其产生了怀疑，于是他携全家老小在宫门前请罪。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08d48627-a193-4900-ab04-b48a26a41c69","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"周顗（yǐ），字伯仁，是当时的名士，他路过宫门口时，王导向其求情，但周顗入而不顾，表现得很冷淡。实际上周顗入宫后极力向晋元帝求情，表明王导与王敦的叛乱无关，晋元帝听从了劝谏，王导才得以保全。但这一切周顗从未告诉过王导。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"00f7fd56-dcba-47d4-9dd6-da25c12c3f19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后来王敦掌权，问王导如何处置周顗，王导没有回复，因为当初他觉得周顗见死不救，心存芥蒂，于是王敦杀了周顗。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91e170ff-5b04-4bca-a9fd-e47406ebb25e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此后王导整理宫中档案，发现当时周顗劝谏的奏疏，才知道当时周顗力保自己，自己却因误解间接害死了他，于是才有了这句经典："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"e32c0e8d-7920-403e-aa72-811a6d852568","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"644247fa-3aff-4cf6-b41c-731bb61906d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"吾虽不杀伯仁，伯仁由我而死。幽冥之中，负此良友！"}]}]}],"tags":["典故","历史"],"createTime":1781497133866,"updateTime":1781933606977,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1781933606977}}